Apply the 69 patches from our 7.2 series that are still additive on top of
next-20260825 (the upstream 7.3 content already covers cgroup-vram/fixes/
hdmi/vesa/preempt-ipi/micro-opts branches and the MM/amd-pstate work).

Applied: CachyOS bbr3/kbuild/cpu-isa/config-hooks/ACPI-BM/S5-eviction,
local PROFILE_PEAK (0003/0004), SMU14 fixes (0001-0007), DCN/EDID
(0030-0058), TLB invalidation (1004-1013), retry-fault series (9011-9023),
userq fixes (9034-9046), bfq/mq-deadline (2000-2004), NAP governor (2200),
zstd 1.6.0 (2100), MES CRIU (1026/1027), vcn-util, soft-evicted.

No .orig/.rej left; all patch -p1 --forward -F2.
